notation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"3匈奴連歲入邊，殺略人民、畜產甚多；雲中、遼東最甚，郡萬餘人。上患之，乃使使遺匈奴書。單于亦使當戶報謝，復與匈奴和親。","content_fanyi":"匈奴连年侵犯边境，杀害、掳掠的百姓和牲畜财产非常多；云中、辽东受害最为严重，每郡都有一万余人。汉文帝对此感到忧虑，便派使臣送信给匈奴。单于也派当户前来答谢，汉朝又与匈奴恢复了和亲关系。","content_jianti_auto":"3匈奴连岁入边，杀略人民、畜产甚多；云中、辽东最甚，郡万余人。上患之，乃使使遗匈奴书。单于亦使当户报谢，复与匈奴和亲。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1208,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f0812be-db0e-11ef-b2d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"高帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"高帝","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d3-db0e-11ef-9a64-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂高帝大臣薨逝之餘，其見存之臣無可相者。見，賢遍翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓高帝大臣薨逝之余，其见存之臣无可相者。见，贤遍翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d2-db0e-11ef-b9db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"申徒狄","people_name_jianti_auto":"申徒狄","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d5-db0e-11ef-aa1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申徒","people_name_jianti_auto":"申徒","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d6-db0e-11ef-8744-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"申侯","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d7-db0e-11ef-a0f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申屠氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"申屠氏","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d8-db0e-11ef-a1dd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f0812d9-db0e-11ef-b321-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","st